Kept on the job", "C": "Credited to WMS", "D": "Sold immediately"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1hj801novzo"}, {"q": "Which head is debited when outturn is transferred to a consignee railway?", "options": {"A": "WMS", "B": "Revenue", "C": "Stores Suspense", "D": "The final/consignee head"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qxr2r8a8nbn"}, {"q": "WMS balances are reviewed by the accounts office?", "options": {"A": "Monthly", "B": "Once in five years", "C": "Never", "D": "Only at audit"}, "answer": "A", "i": "q1vf068qe6ko"}, {"q": "Overheads are charged to manufacture jobs at?", "options": {"A": "Actuals only at year end", "B": "Prescribed oncost rates", "C": "Random rates", "D": "Zero rate"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q1xz42zvr3pi"}, {"q": "Rework cost due to faulty material is charged to?", "options": {"A": "The supplier always", "B": "Revenue", "C": "The job, pending recovery", "D": "Audit"}, "answer": "C", "i": "qmu9wbfc9oq"}, {"q": "Manufacture of wagons mainly takes place at?", "options": {"A": "ICF", "B": "RCF", "C": "CLW", "D": "Railway workshops and production units"}, "answer": "D", "i": "qsihid52vdu"}, {"q": "WMS forms part of which accounts?", "options": {"A": "The production unit's monthly accounts", "B": "Divisional revenue accounts", "C": "Construction capital accounts", "D": "Provident fund accounts"}, "answer": "A", "i": "qzkfg5blbq"}, {"q": "A sudden rise in the WMS debit balance may indicate?", "options": {"A": "Faster transfers", "B": "Accumulation of untransferred outturn", "C": "Higher profits", "D": "Lower costs"}, "answer": "B", "i": "q23q3ppjvbav"}, {"q": "Final clearance of WMS for a manufacture job happens through?", "options": {"A": "Cash sale", "B": "Budget reappropriation", "C": "Transfer entry to the final head", "D": "Lapse of grant"}, "answer": "C", "i": "q1amyoa7v79c"}]